{
  "case": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "And so our focus for today is going to be on the McKinsey interview, even though KPMG is no slacker."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.0,
      "end": 12.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I'm going to walk through this in a way that I think is going to be maybe a little bit more intense."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.0,
      "end": 16.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I'm going to be a little bit more abrupt in the way that I'm thinking about things."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.0,
      "end": 24.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I'm going to push to another level of insight. So Simon, I think that this will feel like somewhere between a McKinsey first round and a KPMG second round."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 29.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "Based on what we're going to do in the session today. And so I'm going to introduce the case."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 35.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I'll walk through the intro of the case. I'll set a timer and I will walk through how long it takes you to do each part of the case."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 41.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "At the end, I'm going to give you reflection on both the timing for each of the pieces as well as segmented performance."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "So we'll highlight what was happening in each part of the case."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "And overall your mission is to solve the case, but probably most importantly, have a really good time."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 60.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "So we'll keep it lighthearted and fun. Everyone who's watching, you know, you guys have the opportunity to do one half of the case, which is to work in your head and on paper with what you would do."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "You are also on mute. So as long as you are on mute, you can keep yourself accountable by talking through it when you're talking through a structure."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "You can walk through the math as Simon's walking through the math. You can also do that later on."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "But please work along with us. It creates a better experience for you from the learning side. So Simon, are you ready?"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 82.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I'm ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.0,
      "end": 85.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I've always been ready. Born ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "So great. We're going to get started in just a second."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "The client today is a company called Agro Kim and the case is named Mango Maker."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 104.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "Agro Kim is an agricultural chemicals producer based in North America."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 112.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "The company manages a wide portfolio of goods that includes specialty seeds for commercial producers, past control and soil additives."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.0,
      "end": 119.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "In R&D, this company developed a slow release fertilizer that helps accelerate the ripening of produce."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.0,
      "end": 127.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "When produce goes to market off cycle, it provides farmers with more assurance that it will be purchased and can even achieve a price premium."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.0,
      "end": 136.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "The product was patented 10 years ago, but has recently come back up into development as something that they would like to finish and commercialize."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.0,
      "end": 140.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "In testing, the chemical worked especially well with tropical fruits."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.0,
      "end": 147.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "And one of those tropical fruits is mangoes. So the company decided to call the product for now, mango maker."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.0,
      "end": 153.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "The majority of mangoes sold in the world are produced in tropical regions, non frost zones."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.0,
      "end": 159.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "And Mexico is one of the top 10 producers with 2.2 million tons produced a year."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.0,
      "end": 166.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "You're kind of like to know if they should have set attempt to commercialize the chemical mango maker specifically in Mexico."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.0,
      "end": 169.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "Do you have any questions about the background?"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.0,
      "end": 175.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "Great. I'm first going to run through what I heard from you to make sure that I heard everything correctly."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.0,
      "end": 176.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "Sounds good."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.0,
      "end": 187.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "So our client is Agro Kim. They produce agricultural and chemical products, special, pretty much specialty seeds, pest control and soil additives."
    },
    {
      "start": 187.0,
      "end": 200.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "They sell these to commercial clients in North America. And they are looking at bring to market a fertilizer which works very well with mangoes."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.0,
      "end": 206.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "And they're specifically going to launch that product in Mexico because that's one of the largest mango markets."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.0,
      "end": 213.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "And so the goal is sort of to see whether or not they should enter this whether or not they should bring this product to development."
    },
    {
      "start": 213.0,
      "end": 218.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "Absolutely. That's it. And I think if you can ask or any questions that you have about that."
    },
    {
      "start": 218.0,
      "end": 229.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "Sure. So just wondering sort of the size of Agro Kim and their current size and generally how big they are."
    },
    {
      "start": 229.0,
      "end": 234.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "So I can understand how big of a deal this product is to their overall business."
    },
    {
      "start": 234.0,
      "end": 242.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "Yeah. I don't have data on it actually. And normally I would, but I didn't pull it together. I think we can assume that it's big."
    },
    {
      "start": 242.0,
      "end": 249.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "This isn't necessarily a complete deal changer for them. So it would be a part of a portfolio of products."
    },
    {
      "start": 249.0,
      "end": 254.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "So I wouldn't assume that it's everything. I also wouldn't assume that it's nothing. How's that for a non-answer?"
    },
    {
      "start": 254.0,
      "end": 256.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "That's great."
    },
    {
      "start": 256.0,
      "end": 262.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "And do they sort of have a timeline of when they're expecting the product will be fully ready to launch?"
    },
    {
      "start": 262.0,
      "end": 272.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "I think that right now it's gone through all of the testing that they would need. So I think we can assume under a year would make sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 272.0,
      "end": 279.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "Great. I'm going to take a moment to structure my thoughts and I'll let you know when ready to work on this question."
    },
    {
      "start": 279.0,
      "end": 282.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
      "text": "Sounds great. Can't wait."
    },
